#. data/fish.json: karkoi.name
msgid "Karkoi"
msgstr ""

#. data/fish.json: karkoi.region
msgid "Deltacross"
msgstr ""

#. data/fish.json: karkoi.description
msgid "A lazy pond fish. It drifts about and gives up quickly."
msgstr ""

#. data/fish.json: karkoi.lore
msgid "Thick around the Deltacross ferry, where a crossing costs 2 pearls and drinks float by in cocona shells."
msgstr ""

#. data/fish.json: bagnazu.name
msgid "Bagnazu"
msgstr ""

#. data/fish.json: bagnazu.region
msgid "Sanbi swamps"
msgstr ""

#. data/fish.json: bagnazu.description
msgid "A heavy bottom-feeder. Reel it up, then keep up as it wanders."
msgstr ""

#. data/fish.json: bagnazu.lore
msgid "Lurks in Sanbi's swamps, where Cruros harvest the very pearls in your pocket. Mind the Crocus."
msgstr ""

#. data/fish.json: magatum.name
msgid "Magatum"
msgstr ""

#. data/fish.json: magatum.region
msgid "Fostwater"
msgstr ""

#. data/fish.json: magatum.description
msgid "Fast and strong, but it burns out: each stage of the fight peaks in the middle. Set the hook, survive its runs, then match its tail beat."
msgstr ""

#. data/fish.json: magatum.lore
msgid "Runs where Fostwater's harbor glows, right where salt water meets fresh."
msgstr ""

#. data/fish.json: sanbi.name
msgid "Sanbi"
msgstr ""

#. data/fish.json: sanbi.region
msgid "Sanbi Dockyard"
msgstr ""

#. data/fish.json: sanbi.description
msgid "Placeholder fight for the canon fish. Ignore its decoys, hold steady, and keep going when you lose sight of it."
msgstr ""

#. data/fish.json: sanbi.lore
msgid "It takes a strong fisher to land two a day, unless you're from the one family the True Sanbi King blessed. Ask the docks about their daily prayer dance."
msgstr ""

